# [optimize] (2026-11-15) Deploy only what the game serves: vercel.json and the game's dist folder (index.html, app.js,
# style.css, assets/). Dev tooling (_reskin_tools), backups (_before_*), design docs (the review deck, the VO manifest) and the
# raw voice-over recordings stay in git but are never uploaded to Vercel. Same syntax as .gitignore.
